{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6834d8c7-d534-86e0-8474-0991e1217a0c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T13:34:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:31:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. This is Judith Almy. I'm on Eustis Avenue, 211 Eustis. I'm calling because I have an application, I think, I'm not totally sure it's the right one, and I want to drop it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What kind of application is it? Building, zoning, something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing. My neighbor said to me, she said, you need the form from the Historic Hill people. And then I said, is that the city or is that a separate thing? And she said, just bring it to City Hall. So I have a form, but it says Zoning on top and also something about a certificate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:31:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's for exterior work in the historic district, that could be a certificate of appropriateness. That usually goes through this office, yeah. What I'd need to see is the form itself. Does it have a title at the top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says Application for... hold on, I have it here. [pause] Application for Review of Exterior Changes. Is that the same? I thought it was a different name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be the same thing, different wording. Bring it in and the counter staff will tell you if it's the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, um, is your office open Saturdays? Because I work during the week and I said to my husband, I'll just do it Saturday, and he said, Judith, I don't think they're open. And I said, well, I'll call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, we're not open Saturdays. City Hall's closed on weekends."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. So what are the hours, then? Like, what time do you open and close?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday through Friday, eight thirty to four thirty. That's the general City Hall schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight thirty to four thirty. And that's Monday to Friday. Not Friday shorter? Because somebody told me Fridays are shorter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I know of. Friday's the same for us. If that changes for a holiday, it'd be posted on the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I'd have to come on my lunch. It's one thirty now, so, no, I can't today. Could I come Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:33:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday's fine. Come to the second floor, or just ask at the front desk and they'll point you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:33:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Second floor. Okay. And do I need to bring anything besides the form? Like pictures?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photos of the existing conditions usually help, and any drawings or a description of what you're changing. The form should list what they want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does have a list, yes. I'll read it over again. Oh, and sorry, this is off topic, but you sound like you know things. My television, we switched it to the, the input thing, and now it just says no signal, and I can't get it back. I press the button and it goes to HDMI and then I don't know. Is that something you'd know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:33:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's not really my department. Try the input or source button on the remote and cycle through until the cable box one comes up. Might be HDMI 1 or 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:34:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did that, and I said to my husband, it's stuck, and he said it's not stuck, you're pressing the wrong one. So I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Might be the wrong remote, honestly. Anyway, for the application, Monday morning, eight thirty and on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Monday, second floor, with the photos. Thank you. I'm still not sure about the form name, but I'll bring it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:34:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, they'll sort it out at the counter. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T13:34:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
